---
title: "Stencil building blocks"
description: "Public primitive props, callbacks, methods and styling."
---

# Stencil building blocks

All optional props without a default remain `undefined`. `class` accepts Svelte `ClassValue`; `style` is a CSS string.

These primitives require and provide no cropper context. Supply their data and callbacks explicitly. Unless listed, they have no exported instance methods. Container children are optional `Snippet` values rendered without arguments.

<h2 id="bounding-box">BoundingBox</h2>

Positions resize controls and emits anchor, displacement and ResizeOptions. `reference` is the crop at gesture start. Custom controls must retain the native event so Shift can preserve aspect ratio.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `style` | `string` | `undefined` |
| `class` | `ClassValue` | `undefined` |
| `handler` | `Snippet<[HandlerSnippetProps]>` | `SimpleHandler` |
| `handlers` | `boolean` \| `Partial<Record<OrdinalDirection, boolean>>` | All eight directions |
| `lines` | `boolean` \| `Partial<Record<CardinalDirection, boolean>>` | All four cardinal directions |
| `line` | `Snippet<[LineSnippetProps]>` | `SimpleLine` |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `false` |
| `onResize` | `(anchor: ResizeAnchor, directions: MoveDirections, options: ResizeOptions) => void` | `undefined` |
| `onResizeEnd` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `children` | `Snippet` | `undefined` |
| `reference` | `Coordinates` \| `null` | `null` |

`handler` and `line` use the [typed control snippet contracts](/docs/reference/snippets#stencil-controls). A boolean controls all positions; a map enables only true entries.

Selectors are listed in the [complete styling inventory](/docs/reference/styling).

<h2 id="stencil-wrapper">StencilWrapper</h2>

Positions the crop region with width, height, left and top. Transitions interpolate its box. Coordinates are in boundary pixels.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `children` | `Snippet` | `undefined` |
| `class` | `ClassValue` | `undefined` |
| `style` | `string` | `undefined` |
| `transitions` | `CropperTransitions` | `undefined` |
| `width` | `number` | `undefined` |
| `height` | `number` | `undefined` |
| `left` | `number` | Required |
| `top` | `number` | Required |

Selectors are listed in the [complete styling inventory](/docs/reference/styling).

<h2 id="stencil-overlay">StencilOverlay</h2>

Overlay surface surrounding the crop region. Its children render inside the overlay.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `class` | `ClassValue` | `undefined` |
| `style` | `string` | `undefined` |
| `children` | `Snippet` | `undefined` |

Selectors are listed in the [complete styling inventory](/docs/reference/styling).

<h2 id="stencil-grid">StencilGrid</h2>

Shows a configurable grid. Hidden grids retain their previous row and column counts until shown again.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `visible` | `boolean` | `false` |
| `columns` | `number` | `3` |
| `rows` | `number` | `3` |
| `class` | `ClassValue` | `undefined` |
| `style` | `string` | `undefined` |

Selectors are listed in the [complete styling inventory](/docs/reference/styling).

<h2 id="handler-wrapper">HandlerWrapper</h2>

Draggable hit target for one resize handle. `position` takes precedence over the split horizontal/vertical fields. Movement uses layout pixels; pass through the native event.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `class` | `ClassValue` | `undefined` |
| `style` | `string` | `undefined` |
| `children` | `Snippet` | `undefined` |
| `onMove` | `(shift: MoveDirections, event: MouseEvent` \| `TouchEvent) => void` | `undefined` |
| `onMoveEnd` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `onLeave` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `onEnter` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `undefined` |
| `position` | `OrdinalDirection` | `undefined` |
| `horizontalPosition` | `HorizontalCardinalDirection` \| `null` | `undefined` |
| `verticalPosition` | `VerticalCardinalDirection` \| `null` | `undefined` |

Selectors are listed in the [complete styling inventory](/docs/reference/styling).

<h2 id="line-wrapper">LineWrapper</h2>

Draggable hit target for one edge. Activation distance is zero; forwards movement and completion.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `class` | `ClassValue` | `undefined` |
| `style` | `string` | `undefined` |
| `children` | `Snippet` | `undefined` |
| `onMove` | `(directions: MoveDirections, event: TouchEvent` \| `MouseEvent) => void` | `undefined` |
| `onMoveEnd` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `onLeave` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `onEnter` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `undefined` |
| `position` | `HorizontalCardinalDirection` \| `VerticalCardinalDirection` | `undefined` |

Selectors are listed in the [complete styling inventory](/docs/reference/styling).

<h2 id="simple-handler">SimpleHandler</h2>

Default handle appearance using HandlerWrapper. `class` and `style` land on the outer hit target. It consumes position, horizontalPosition, verticalPosition, disabled, onMove and onMoveEnd; wrapper children and hover callbacks are not forwarded.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `class` | `ClassValue` | `undefined` |
| `style` | `string` | `undefined` |
| `children` | `Snippet` | `undefined` |
| `onMove` | `(shift: MoveDirections, event: MouseEvent` \| `TouchEvent) => void` | `undefined` |
| `onMoveEnd` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `onLeave` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `onEnter` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `undefined` |
| `position` | `OrdinalDirection` | `undefined` |
| `horizontalPosition` | `HorizontalCardinalDirection` \| `null` | `undefined` |
| `verticalPosition` | `VerticalCardinalDirection` \| `null` | `undefined` |

Selectors are listed in the [complete styling inventory](/docs/reference/styling).

<h2 id="simple-line">SimpleLine</h2>

Default edge appearance using LineWrapper. `class` and `style` land on the outer hit target. It consumes position, disabled, onMove and onMoveEnd; wrapper children and hover callbacks are not forwarded.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `class` | `ClassValue` | `undefined` |
| `style` | `string` | `undefined` |
| `children` | `Snippet` | `undefined` |
| `onMove` | `(directions: MoveDirections, event: TouchEvent` \| `MouseEvent) => void` | `undefined` |
| `onMoveEnd` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `onLeave` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `onEnter` | `() => void` | `undefined` |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `undefined` |
| `position` | `HorizontalCardinalDirection` \| `VerticalCardinalDirection` | `undefined` |

Selectors are listed in the [complete styling inventory](/docs/reference/styling).
